msgstr "시작하기 {#get-started}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide demonstrates basic usage of the Constrained Quantum Optimizer by showing how to load the function and execute simple problems. For a more involved tutorial, see [Find the Maximum Independent Set with the Aqarios Constrained Quantum Optimizer](/tutorials/find-the-maximum-independent-set-with-aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer).\n"
msgstr "이 가이드는 함수를 로드하고 간단한 문제를 실행하는 방법을 보여줌으로써 제약 양자 최적화기의 기본 사용법을 보여줍니다. 더 심화된 튜토리얼은 [Aqarios 제약 양자 최적화기로 최대 독립 집합 찾기](/tutorials/find-the-maximum-independent-set-with-aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer)를 참조하세요.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26 · verified 2026-09-29
